{% import "macros.html.j2" as m with context %}
<div class="legend" role="group" aria-labelledby="{{ p.pre }}-lg">
<p class="lg-h" id="{{ p.pre }}-lg">How to read the graph</p>
<ul class="lg">
<li class="lg-dirs">{% for d in DIR_ORDER %}<span>{{ m.dir_label(d) }}</span>{% endfor %}</li>
<li class="lg-certs"><span class="lbl">Certainty</span>{% for c in CERT_ORDER %}<span>{{ m.cert_label(c) }}</span>{% endfor %}</li>
<li><svg class="sw" viewBox="0 0 64 16" width="64" height="16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 4H62" stroke-width="1.5"/><path d="M2 12H62" stroke-width="6"/></svg><span>Line width = number of studies. The arrow points at what changes.</span></li>
<li class="js-only"><svg class="sw" viewBox="0 0 64 16" width="64" height="16" aria-hidden="true"><path class="near" d="M2 4H62"/><path class="far" d="M2 12H62"/></svg><span>After a click on a node: full lines are one step from it, thin light lines are further steps. Edges beyond the first step are separate bodies of evidence.</span></li>
<li><svg class="sw" viewBox="0 0 64 16" width="64" height="16" aria-hidden="true"><path class="gp1" d="M2 8H62"/><path class="gp2" d="M2 8H62"/></svg><span><span class="gapword">No evidence</span> = a gap: no study tested this pairing. Not a negative result.</span></li>
{% if p.is_b %}
<li><svg class="sw" viewBox="0 0 64 16" width="64" height="16" aria-hidden="true"><path class="modl" d="M2 8H52"/><path class="modd" d="M52 8L57 3L62 8L57 13z"/></svg><span>Moderation (dotted, ends in <span aria-hidden="true">◆</span>): changes the size of the effect on the edge whose chip the diamond touches.</span></li>
<li><svg class="sw" viewBox="0 0 64 16" width="64" height="16" aria-hidden="true"><path class="mem" d="M2 8H62"/></svg><span>Member of a combination — not an evidence edge.</span></li>
<li class="lg-shapes"><span><svg viewBox="0 0 12 12" width="12" height="12" aria-hidden="true"><path class="bdg" d="M1 11L6 1L11 11z"/></svg> Planting stock</span><span><svg viewBox="0 0 12 12" width="12" height="12" aria-hidden="true"><rect class="bdg" x="1" y="1" width="10" height="10" rx="1"/></svg> Site treatment</span><span><svg viewBox="0 0 12 12" width="12" height="12" aria-hidden="true"><circle class="bdg" cx="6" cy="6" r="5.5"/></svg> Condition</span><span><svg viewBox="0 0 22 12" width="22" height="12" aria-hidden="true"><rect class="obox" x="1" y="1" width="20" height="10" rx="5"/></svg> Outcome</span></li>
{% endif %}
</ul>
</div>
